      "content": "sacred／sacrosanct 貼上聖封。sanctuary／sanctify／saint 庇護所與封聖儀式。sacrifice／sacrificial 獻祭交換；sanction／sanctimonious／consecrate 制裁、假神聖、奉獻——署長：methods 可 sacred；ego 不可 sacrosanct。"
    },
